<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINA BEAT ECUADOR 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA BEAT ECUADOR 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina beat Ecuador 2-1 (halftime 2-0) in a South American World Cup qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Argentina - Ariel Ortega (17), Hernan Crespo (32)</p>
<p>Ecuador - Alex Aguinaga (67)</p>
<p>Attendance: 65,000</p>
